{"version": 2, "width": 96, "height": 34, "title": "pit-consensus MCP demo"}
[0.022, "o", "\u001b[1m\u276f What was NVDA's FY2025 EPS consensus on 2024-05-31, split-adjusted?\u001b[0m\n"]
[0.022, "o", "\n"]
[4.529, "o", "\u001b[2m  \u23fa Skill: query-pit-consensus\u001b[0m\n"]
[8.755, "o", "\u001b[36m  \u23fa get_consensus(ticker='NVDA', fiscal_period='FY2025', as_of='2024-05-31',\u001b[0m\n"]
[8.755, "o", "\u001b[36m      basis='adjusted')\u001b[0m\n"]
[8.996, "o", "\u001b[32m    \u23bf mean 2.588 \u00b7 median 2.583 \u00b7 8 estimates \u00b7 1 excluded \u00b7 latest known share basis: after\u001b[0m\n"]
[8.996, "o", "\u001b[32m      the 2024-06-10 10-for-1 split\u001b[0m\n"]
[9.495, "o", "\u001b[36m  \u23fa get_consensus(ticker='NVDA', fiscal_period='FY2025', as_of='2024-05-31',\u001b[0m\n"]
[9.495, "o", "\u001b[36m      basis='unadjusted')\u001b[0m\n"]
[9.597, "o", "\u001b[32m    \u23bf mean 25.885 \u00b7 median 25.825 \u00b7 8 estimates \u00b7 1 excluded \u00b7 share basis in effect on\u001b[0m\n"]
[9.597, "o", "\u001b[32m      2024-05-31, after the 2021-07-20 4-for-1 split\u001b[0m\n"]
[12.798, "o", "\n"]
[12.798, "o", "  USD 2.59 (median USD 2.58) as of 2024-05-31, split-adjusted, from 8 estimates. The\n"]
[12.798, "o", "  estimates are synthetic. This is on the post-split share basis, after the 10-for-1 split\n"]
[12.798, "o", "  announced 2024-05-22 and effective 2024-06-10. On that day's own share basis it was USD\n"]
[12.798, "o", "  25.88. One estimate was left out because it wasn't re-confirmed after the 2024-05-22\n"]
[12.798, "o", "  earnings release. The tool returned no warnings.\n"]
[12.851, "o", "\n"]
[12.851, "o", "\u001b[2m  (12s \u00b7 live Claude Code run \u00b7 estimates are synthetic)\u001b[0m\n"]
[12.851, "o", "\n"]
[13.765, "o", "\u001b[1m\u276f How was the split handled for that number? Use explain_adjustment.\u001b[0m\n"]
[13.765, "o", "\n"]
[17.187, "o", "\u001b[36m  \u23fa explain_adjustment(ticker='NVDA', date='2024-05-31', fiscal_period='FY2025')\u001b[0m\n"]
[17.388, "o", "\u001b[32m    \u23bf SPLIT ratio 10 (ex-date 2024-06-10, announced 2024-05-22 20:21 UTC): estimates on the\u001b[0m\n"]
[17.388, "o", "\u001b[32m      earlier share basis are divided by 10\u001b[0m\n"]
[22.527, "o", "\n"]
[22.527, "o", "  The adjustment used NVIDIA's 10-for-1 split, announced 2024-05-22 and effective\n"]
[22.527, "o", "  2024-06-10, with the SEC filing as its source. All 8 estimates were still on the pre-split\n"]
[22.527, "o", "  basis, so each was divided by 10. Two brokers labelled their basis themselves; for the\n"]
[22.527, "o", "  other six it was worked out from each broker's previous estimate and the split ratio. None\n"]
[22.527, "o", "  was a guess. A plain average of the raw numbers gives 25.53, versus USD 2.59 adjusted.\n"]
[22.586, "o", "\n"]
[22.586, "o", "\u001b[2m  (8s \u00b7 live Claude Code run \u00b7 estimates are synthetic)\u001b[0m\n"]
[22.586, "o", "\n"]
